# knobs.manifest — every knob scripts/loop.config.template declares, with its READER.
# harness-selfcheck.sh asserts each `script:` reader mentions the knob and each `config:` function is
# defined; the kitchen's harness-tests.sh asserts every template knob is listed here and every
# `recipe:` knob appears in SKILL.md. A knob with no reader is decoration, and this harness shipped
# five of them before anything counted (MUTATION_TARGETS, REVIEW_BUDGET_CRITICAL, REVIEW_DIMENSIONS,
# COVERAGE_TARGET_PCT, EFFORT_*). An explicit list, not a scanner: the scanner was tried, failed open,
# and shipped two bugs of its own (LEARNINGS.md, "The knob with no reader").
STACK                         script:gate.sh
SPEC_DIR                      script:loop-driver.sh
E2E_TAG_TICKET_PREFIX         script:gate.sh
